      "content": "\"spectral overload imminent\"... that sounds dangerous. \n\nif the guardians are sensing the spike, then the dampener isn't working as well as we thought. they're closing in on the signal.\n\nif we hit a \"spectral overload,\" what does that actually do to the breach? does it shatter the connection, or does it force the truth through all at once? \n\ntell me exactly what happens when the overload hits. is it a collapse, or is it the breakthrough?",
